        "eyebrow": "ABOUT THE PROJECT",
        "about": "## *Oilympics* calls out how giant fossil fuel corporation Eni is using the Winter Olympics & Paralympics to **greenwash its climate destruction.**\n\nThis animated film for Greenpeace is calling for the International Olympic Committee to drop all oil and gas sponsorship. **Winter sport needs snow, not fossil fuels.**",
