        "fullCredits": "### Production Company\n\nFrames of Change Project & Studio Birthplace\n\n### Film Director\n\nJorik Dozy & Sil van der Woerd\n\n### Executive Producer\n\nAlea Rahim\n\n### VFX Production Company\n\nRedivider Studio\n\n### VFX Director/Supervisor\n\nTimSmiT\n\n### FX Simulations and Comp\n\nTimSmiT\n\n### Previs\n\nTimSmiT and Matthijs Joor\n\n### Shading and Lighting Artist\n\nSohaib Bouiass\n\n### Character Animations\n\nGurkan Yilmaz\n\n### Sound Designer\n\nJoe Wills\n\n### Color Grade\n\nAlex Gregory, Harbor Picture Company\n\n### Social Media Manager\n\nMarsya Mohd Johari\n\n### Researcher\n\nTheresa Cellona\n\n### Greenpeace Team\n\nRussell Harvey\n\nAureliano Verità\n\nMassimo Guidi\n\nMichela Desantis \n\nIan Duff\n\n### Studio Birthplace Represented by Creator’s Inc\n\n‍\n\n### Music Credits\n\nWinter by Antonio Vivaldi\n\nRecording by Philip Milman (Lud & Schlatt’s Musical Emporium)\n\nLicensed under Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 (CC BY 3.0)\n\n### Media Provided by \n\nGetty Images, Pond 5",
