    {
      "id": "text-7",
      "type": "text",
      "content": {
        "heading": "Screen to Streets",
        "body": "Following the release of the film, Greenpeace Italy held protests and a demonstration in front of the Piazza Duomo, Milan, installing our oil-dripping Olympic Rings in real life.\n\n‍\n\nThe campaign sparked international coverage and pressured both Eni and the International Olympic Committee to respond.\n\n‍\n\n**More than 70k people have signed Greenpeace’s petition, which has been delivered to the International Olympic Committee.**"
      },
      "padTop": "4-5",
      "padBottom": "4-5"
